      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a really strong start. The tone is exactly where it needs to be—very elegant. \n\nI just ran it through our internal tool and the richness score came back a bit lower than I was hoping for. It's a decent score, but for a flagship launch, we really want to push that metric higher. \n\nCan you do another pass on this? Try to make it even more lush and descriptive. Just a reminder: please don't let it get weird or start just listing words; it still needs to feel like seamless, high-end storytelling, but I definitely need that vocabulary score to go up.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
